I. Smallfry

- arrow keys interpreted as esc
    - this has grown on me though - keep? but formalize if so
- the rendered UI does not properly display empty buttons for 'qwerty' and 'asdfgh' rows
    - this is due to the ui template being constrained to 4 buttons for the two keyrows.
    - ez fix is to adjust template.
    - rabbithole solution is to have app write template to rowspec

II. The wishlist

1. Set ops on filesets
    - probably requires new ingestion strat, as filesets may depend upon other filesets



2. Add next numeral line to history output instructions
    [ ] 'a_lib/templates/documentation/backlog.template': Update history output instruction format
        - append a trailing 'Next item numeral: <FOLLOWING_ROMAN_NUMERAL>' marker to history output instructions
        - prevent Roman numeral sequence miscalculations when feeding truncated history files back to LLMs

3: MUST make it possible to add repo content from other locs than just assets. why is test system bugging out about that.


4. git-ops, save file:
    - perhaps we can have a stack of branches? (main -> dev-1 -> dev-2 -> dev-n)
        - allows one to hansel and gretel that sob, not having to step to main 
    - single click dropoff, none of that double ctrl+d stuff
    - automation of the bl migration

