```text
1. Reshape KB-service command/result hierarchy: replace KbCmdResult with KbServiceEmission, eliminate RenderContext, split render command, prune dead code
    [x] 'content/core/engine_deps/result.py': Reshape the command/result class hierarchy
        - Remove PromptRenderOutput (dead, no references anywhere)
        - Remove RenderContext, StandardRenderContext, HotRenderContext
        - Remove KbCmdResult
        - Introduce KbServiceEmission: plain class (no inheritance), fields: kb: Keyboard, ui_render: Render, cmd: Command
        - All former KbCmdResult subclasses now inherit (KbServiceEmission, Result): BootstrapSuccess, UnboundKeyResult, DomainSelectedResult, UninhabitedDomainResult, UninhabitedPromptResult
        - DomainSelectedResult / UninhabitedDomainResult keep their btn: DomButton field
        - UninhabitedPromptResult keeps its btn: PromptButton field
        - BootstrapSuccess.cmd typed as StartCmd (was None)
        - Remove RenderPromptCmd; introduce RenderNormalPromptCmd(KbServiceEmission, Command) and RenderHotPromptCmd(KbServiceEmission, Command), both with field prompt: Prompt (identical shape, no btn, no ctx)
        - PromptRenderResult inherits (KbServiceEmission, Result), fields: text: str, lines: int, chars: int (no btn, no ctx)
        - Result and Command remain plain marker classes (no fields)
    [x] 'content/core/engine.py': Update run() match cases
        - Replace `case RenderPromptCmd():` with `case RenderNormalPromptCmd() | RenderHotPromptCmd():`
        - No other changes; isinstance(item, Result) still works for post_response dispatch
    [x] 'content/modules/keyboard/keyboard_service.py': Update emissions to use new command types
        - _handle_prompt_btn: return RenderNormalPromptCmd(cmd=cmd, kb=self.kb, ui_render=self.ui_render, prompt=...) or RenderHotPromptCmd(...) depending on last_prompt logic
        - Remove all RenderContext / StandardRenderContext / HotRenderContext construction
        - handle_start: pass cmd=cmd (StartCmd) into BootstrapSuccess instead of None
    [x] 'content/modules/render_pipeline/render_service.py': Update render_prompt signature and body
        - Signature: render_prompt(self, cmd: RenderNormalPromptCmd | RenderHotPromptCmd) -> PromptRenderResult
        - _get_template: read cmd.prompt.render.template (no ctx)
        - _get_repl_map: match on cmd type (RenderNormalPromptCmd vs RenderHotPromptCmd); read cmd.prompt, cmd.kb directly (no ctx)
        - Remove all RenderContext / StandardRenderContext / HotRenderContext references
        - PromptRenderResult construction: pass cmd=cmd, kb=cmd.kb, ui_render=cmd.ui_render, text, lines, chars
    [x] 'content/modules/tui/tui_service.py': Update post_response for web slot lookup
        - Web path: id(result.cmd.cmd) instead of id(result.cmd) (cmd is now the render command, .cmd is the KbCmd)
        - TUI path: unchanged (isinstance checks on Result / PromptRenderResult still hold)
    [x] 'content/modules/web_frontend/web_frontend_service.py': Update slot correlation
        - post_response: self._pending.pop(id(result.cmd.cmd), None) for render results
        - asdict(result) still serializes kb, ui_render, text, lines, chars via KbServiceEmission fields
    [x] 'content/modules/tui/renderer.py': Verify shape_command_result and render_view field reads
        - shape_command_result: reads lines, chars from PromptRenderResult — unchanged
        - render_view: reads kb, ui_render — unchanged (both on KbServiceEmission)
        - No code change expected, confirmed no stale references to RenderContext or old field names
